###Mapping
Mapping test::solarcove3::mapping::DockFromReading
(
  *test::solarcove3::domain::Dock[dock]: Pure
  {
    ~src test::solarcove3::source::DockReading
    dockId: $src.dockId,
    stationCode: $src.stationCode,
    zone: $src.zone,
    capacity: $src.capacity,
    bikesAvailable: $src.bikesAvailable,
    statusCode: $src.statusCode,
    operatorName: $src.operatorName,
    tier: $src.tier
  }
)
